msgstr "Registrar una prueba"

msgid "Sample checked, observed gaps, people interviewed..."
msgstr "Muestra revisada, desviaciones observadas, personas entrevistadas..."

msgid ""
"Required if the control is not fully effective. An ineffective control opens "
"a non-conformity."
msgstr ""
"Obligatorio si el control no es plenamente eficaz. Un control ineficaz abre "
"una no conformidad."

msgid "A document of the control:"
msgstr "Un documento del control:"

