msgid ""
"The register of personal data breaches: every breach is documented, whether "
"or not it was notified, with its facts, effects and the measures taken."
msgstr ""
"El registro de violaciones de datos personales: cada violación se documenta, "
"notificada o no, con sus hechos, sus efectos y las medidas adoptadas."

msgid ""
"Record each breach as soon as it is known (from the security incident when "
"there is one), decide within 72 h whether to notify the supervisory "
"authority and write down why, decide whether to inform the people concerned, "
"then export the register when the authority asks for it."
msgstr ""
"Inscriba cada violación en cuanto se conozca (desde el incidente de "
"seguridad si existe), decida en 72 h si notifica a la autoridad de control y "
"anote por qué, decida si informa a los interesados y exporte el registro "
"cuando la autoridad lo pida."

msgid "GDPR, articles 33 and 34"
msgstr "RGPD, artículos 33 y 34"

msgid ""
"Proposal prepared from the security incident: check and complete it, then "
"click Add. Nothing is recorded until you do, and the incident is not changed."
msgstr ""
"Propuesta preparada a partir del incidente de seguridad: revísela y "
"complétela, luego haga clic en Añadir. No se guarda nada antes, y el "
"incidente no se modifica."

