"Answer the climate change question in the context of the organization before "
"marking this requirement compliant."
msgstr ""
"Responda a la pregunta sobre el cambio climático en el contexto de la "
"organización antes de marcar este requisito como conforme."

msgid ""
"The context of the organization: the internal and external issues that "
"affect information security, and the interested parties with their "
"expectations and what the ISMS retains."
msgstr ""
"El contexto de la organización: las cuestiones internas y externas que "
"afectan a la seguridad de la información, y las partes interesadas con sus "
"expectativas y lo que el SGSI considera."

msgid ""
"List the issues and the interested parties, decide for each one whether the "
"ISMS retains it, link the related risks, obligations and controls, answer "
"the climate change question, and review each item at least once a year. Use "
"the export of the list for the auditor."
msgstr ""
"Enumere las cuestiones y las partes interesadas, decida para cada una si el "
"SGSI la considera, vincule los riesgos, obligaciones y controles "
"relacionados, responda a la pregunta sobre el cambio climático y revise cada "
"elemento al menos una vez al año. Use la exportación de la lista para el "
"auditor."

msgid "ISO/IEC 27001, clauses 4.1 and 4.2"
msgstr "ISO/IEC 27001, cláusulas 4.1 y 4.2"

msgid "View the context item"
msgstr "Ver el elemento del contexto"

msgid ""
"Check that the issue or the interested party is still accurate "
"(expectations, decision, links with risks and controls), then set the next "
