"Findings tab of the audit, with the reference given by the body. Treat each "
"finding (cause, action, owner, due date, evidence in the Documents tab) "
"until it is verified. Export the PDF and hand it to the auditor at the "
"opening meeting of the next audit."
msgstr ""
